{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Endless undead. Smash or be eaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The virus spread fast. Society fell faster. Now you\u2019re stuck in tight, makeshift combat zones overrun with the infected. With only your reflexes, a handful of power-ups, and pure grit, you\u2019ll fight wave after wave of zombies in a fast-paced survival arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Smash delivers retro-style top-down gameplay with a modern twist: tight arenas, constant pressure, and satisfying zombie destruction. All backed by bold visuals and a high-energy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Survive the Horde</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead don\u2019t stop coming. Clear waves with precision and speed or get overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Power-Up Mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow time, trigger chain lightning, unleash nukes, and more. The right power-up can turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 Arena-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small handcrafted maps create fast, focused battles. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Retro Action Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom music keeps the adrenaline pumping as the chaos ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Pure Arcade Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No online required. No accounts. No microtransactions. Just gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb Built for Windows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs natively on Windows 10 and above (64-bit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for smooth and responsive arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae How It Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drop into a closed zombie-infested arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Move fast, shoot faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grab power-ups. Avoid swarms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Last as long as you can. Then go again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a shot at glory. And a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready. Aim. Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are waiting.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Blood","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917950/a755cb47fc64d472ab84c4e67da690e2c3025a86.jpg"},{"name":"Zombie Slayer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917950/137f521b3cec5d65ddd427922fea3eca2de80ccc.jpg"},{"name":"Power-up Collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917950/066da799e8e7ae4e881b7a5a69f66fa165d02a87.jpg"},{"name":"Rich Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917950/2b8e5ab1032302452fb90b3a99a5812d5c6344fc.jpg"},{"name":"Survivor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3917950/cd43f6f4b4e0f1b1ec1f6005ed24bdc35b1cc1e3.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917950?t=1764225930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3917950?t=1764225930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917950/e310d1969d10a4b0f709d33563d4000aa88b4a6c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764225930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917950/e310d1969d10a4b0f709d33563d4000aa88b4a6c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764225930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One arena. Endless undead. Smash or be eaten.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The virus spread fast. Society fell faster. Now you\u2019re stuck in tight, makeshift combat zones overrun with the infected. With only your reflexes, a handful of power-ups, and pure grit, you\u2019ll fight wave after wave of zombies in a fast-paced survival arcade experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Smash delivers retro-style top-down gameplay with a modern twist: tight arenas, constant pressure, and satisfying zombie destruction. All backed by bold visuals and a high-energy soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd11 Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf Survive the Horde</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead don\u2019t stop coming. Clear waves with precision and speed or get overwhelmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Power-Up Mayhem</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slow time, trigger chain lightning, unleash nukes, and more. The right power-up can turn the tide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde8 Arena-Based Combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Small handcrafted maps create fast, focused battles. Every second counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb5 Retro Action Soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom music keeps the adrenaline pumping as the chaos ramps up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Pure Arcade Fun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No online required. No accounts. No microtransactions. Just gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbb Built for Windows</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs natively on Windows 10 and above (64-bit).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for smooth and responsive arcade action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae How It Works</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Drop into a closed zombie-infested arena</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Move fast, shoot faster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Grab power-ups. Avoid swarms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Last as long as you can. Then go again</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is a shot at glory. And a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2e3b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ready. Aim. Smash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The undead are waiting.</p>","developers":["TeranByte"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3917950/d876513a9de9b40c2c32bed6c96df964e44dbe35/header.jpg?t=1764225930","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Shawn Futeran. All rights reserved","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trai